        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, consumer mix, Bereich 1</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, consumer mix, Bereich 1
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for the year 2018.;
UUID: 57647374-f5f3-3a80-876b-8daf8b268bb6
Included are the shares of domestic electricity production  and imports by technology at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Switzerland and from imports.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistical data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_57647374-f5f3-3a80-876b-8daf8b268bb6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
